From: VIKINGYFY <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:22:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] system: accept an initial filesystem payload directory

Allow LuCI to select a filesystem payload directory when a new system is
initialized. Create the owner, database and filesystem storage, and
persist the built-in storage policy in the same database transaction.
Existing initialized systems retain their configured storage and policy.

Use the core storage defaults directly rather than maintaining a second
retention configuration. Filesystem failures roll back initialization;
never downgrade a configured filesystem deployment to database payloads.

Base-Commit: 0896305eeee89435049575d55a813f72901f703b

